{
 "_doc": "Crime (task 04): burglary, street robbery, assault, murder, serial killer, theft by guests. Rates are per household / person / town per game year at the Rare default. The hour-limited ones are multiplied up because only the night hours pass the condition (burglary 2.4 x 6/24 = 0.6 a year; robbery 2.2 while out at night ~0.1 a year for a night-walker). Murder and assault have rate 0 on purpose: they come from motive (scripts/systems/crime_murder.gd, crime_assault.gd); the incidents exist for the F9 force button. The case record and all follow-up (discovery, police, trial) live in data/justice.json + scripts/systems/case_*.gd, justice_*.gd.",
